      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Amend: until the Trip is In progress (P12) the Planner can\nchange anything under the same rules. Each Amend sends the whole\nTrip as a new version. Taking a Shipment off sends it back to\nPlanned and publishes ShipmentTakenOffTrip.",
